@anon.b08dd5f4f09c4be6245191ddd275a566.499 = private unnamed_addr constant [461 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for uses of `logging.WARN`.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AThe `logging.WARN` constant is an undocumented alias for `logging.WARNING`.\0A\0AAlthough it\E2\80\99s not explicitly deprecated, `logging.WARN` is not mentioned\0Ain the `logging` documentation. Prefer `logging.WARNING` instead.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aimport logging\0A\0A\0Alogging.basicConfig(level=logging.WARN)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aimport logging\0A\0A\0Alogging.basicConfig(level=logging.WARNING)\0A```\0A", align 1
